      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm not suggesting using St. John's Wort, as it can interact with warfarin and affect blood clotting. However, there are other natural alternatives you can consider to boost your mood and energy while taking warfarin. S-adenosylmethionine (SAMe) and omega-3 fatty acids are often recommended by healthcare professionals for their mood-enhancing properties without known interactions with warfarin. Always consult your doctor before adding any supplements to your regimen.",
