      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info!! 1600mg sounds like a decent amount so i'll probably start there to see if it helps quickly. also i was reading online that vitamin e is also really good for energy and mood, is it safe to take that alongside the same and the omega-3s? i'm thinking of just getting a high dose supplement to really kickstart things",
